---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import { businessConfig as b } from "@/config/businessConfig";
export const prerender=true;
---
<BaseLayout title="About UNITED Water Damage Restoration | Santa Clara" description="UNITED provides clear, measured water mitigation and structural drying for San Jose, Santa Clara, and the Bay Area.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow light">Why UNITED</p><h1>Restore control before the building is restored.</h1><p>Water damage is disruptive. The response should make the situation easier to understand, not harder.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell prose-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our operating idea</p><h2>Measure first. Explain clearly. Dry deliberately.</h2></div><div><p>UNITED WATER DAMAGE RESTORATION is based at {b.address.street} in Santa Clara and serves San Jose and the surrounding Bay Area.</p><p>The work centers on water mitigation, extraction, moisture mapping, controlled structural drying, monitoring, and documented next steps. The website intentionally makes no unverified claim about certifications, insurance relationships, awards, response times, or around-the-clock availability.</p><p>As verified credentials and authentic field documentation are supplied, the system is ready to display them without changing the core experience.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
